      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "TITLE",
      "narration_text": "Namaste — this is Liam, in for Ameya. Margin lets you trade with borrowed money. It can double your gains, and it is the fastest way I know to lose more than you put in.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B01",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.99,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B01",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:45:07"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Start with ten thousand dollars. Under Regulation T your broker lends you another ten, so you control twenty thousand — a two times multiplier.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.96,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:45:07"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Now the stock falls twenty percent. The position is worth sixteen thousand, but you still owe ten. Your own equity just dropped forty percent — double the loss.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.13,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:45:07"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "And you do not control the exit. Slip below the maintenance margin — say thirty percent — and the broker sells you out, at the worst possible time.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.94,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B04",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:45:07"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "LIST",
      "narration_text": "Short selling is the mirror image, and look at the asymmetry. Buy, and the worst case is minus one hundred percent. Short, and the loss is unbounded — a rising stock never has to stop.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B05",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 11.86,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B05",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:45:07"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "So here is the honest verdict. Margin is a multiplier, not a strategy. Know the downside before you borrow.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
